0.1.3 (10-08-2026)
=====
* Fix segfault when a plugin leaves its name, author or explanation unset.
* Add `FREI0R_PATH` environment variable, a colon-separated list of directories searched for plugins before the default ones.
* Detect frei0r through `pkg-config` and skip the build when it is missing.
* Require dune 3.23 or later.

0.1.2 (03-13-2021)
=====
* Changed internal bindings to avoid using global roots.
* Switch to dune!

0.1.1 (03-08-2015)
=====
* Dummy github release.

0.1.0 (18-02-2013)
=====
* Initial release.
